{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The last voice you want to hear blares out the line..][/nomarkup] #line:03673f5
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your ex.][/nomarkup]  
{$exspouse}: Oh thank God you answered! Are you alright? Nobody has been able to reach you. I was getting worried. #line:0acac77 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The worst part is you know their concern is sincere.][/nomarkup] #line:08f0ead 
-> {$pcName}: Sorry, I was sleeping. #line:0668f0e 
    {$exspouse}: Okay? It's 8. Your phone's been ringing all day. Clients. #line:0fc5976 
-> {$pcName}: Not going to lie to you, I've been better. #line:064ad29 
    {$exspouse}: Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. #line:04a938f 
-> {$pcName}: [nomarkup][Hang up.][/nomarkup] #line:05fcbfb 
