{$exspouse}: Well listen, sorry if this is bad timing, but I'm stressing about the - my mortgage, and I was wondering if you have any updates about the money I lent you. #line:03744d9 
-> {$pcName}: I'm working on it. Give me time. (Charisma + Persuasion) #line:0c5da88 
    <<if Roll("Charisma","Persuasion") >= 2>>
        {$exspouse}: Okay. I trust you. Just keep me updated, alright? #success #success #line:00bd597  
        {$exspouse}: I'll let you get to it then. Bye. 
        <<jump AfterPhoneCall>>
    <<else>>
        {$exspouse}: You've been saying that for months now. Look, I tried to help you get back your feet and start your agency, but I feel like I'm running out of options here #failure #line:0f845ee 
