            <<jump AfterPhoneCall>>
        -> {$pcName}: Fuck off with your vague threats. #line:08ed2f8 
            {$exspouse}: I'm not going to fight with you, just pay me by the end of the month before this escalates. #line:0b97426 
            {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The line clicks.][/nomarkup]
        -> {$pcName}: [nomarkup][Hang up.][/nomarkup] #line:0d17798 
            {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Arthur desperately mutters something before the line clicks.][/nomarkup] #line:07ea3e2 
